    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Multi-window error-budget burn rate for the 99.9% app SLO. Google SRE fast/slow-burn: fast (1h) line crossing 14.4 or slow (6h) crossing 6 means page. Tracks unexpected registration errors (reason=error), not user validation friction.",
